    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0040_doctor_03",
      "hash": "d72bd27e070853b0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「嘿，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要去哪裡！\\n快給我回來！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0040_rival_02",
      "hash": "14283ebd92c1b1c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_01",
      "hash": "300dda520826e5ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「大木博士！\\c\\n那裡剛才明明就只有２個精靈球，\\n現在不知道為什麼，\\r\\n變成３個了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_01",
      "hash": "4e6eefdd0a5feaff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「沒事沒事！\\n多的那個是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]剛才\\r\\n捉到的[VAR POKNAME(0002)]喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_02",
      "hash": "300dd9520826e3fb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\n自己捉到的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_03",
      "hash": "300dd8520826e248",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇！嚇我一跳。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_02",
      "hash": "4e6ef0dd0a5fecb2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哇哈哈哈！\\n還真是有意思！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_04",
      "hash": "4e6eeadd0a5fe280",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]啊！\\n這次[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可要把精靈球\\r\\n好好拿在手裡喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_doctor_03",
      "hash": "4e6ef1dd0a5fee65",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了，這次[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可一定\\n要把[VAR POKNAME(0002)]拿到手喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_04",
      "hash": "300ddf520826ee2d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳捉到的寶可夢\\n好像是在中間那個球裡面。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0040_new_rival_05",
      "hash": "300dde520826ec7a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「牠好像在說\\n『不是那邊啦』！"
    }
  ],
